      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "3 Application of amendments",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 6,
      "values:originalText": "The amendments made by items 1 and 2 apply to acts done, or practices\nengaged in, after the commencement of this Part.\n\nAmendment of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 1\nExtension of correction rights to non-Australians  Part 2\n\nPrivacy Amendment Act 2004                 3"
    },
